(467, 'Mateo', 'Sanz de Santos', 'SanFrutos Catalogue ', 'Bonjour!\r\n\r\nHi, my name is Mateo, co-owner and sales director at Cerveza SanFutos in Spain. We are a young craft brewery placed in Segovia, to the north of Madrid. We are looking for a partner to export our beers in France and some friends and colleages has recommend us to contact you. \r\n\r\nWe have two different production lines:\r\n\r\n-New realises: New beers every week, colaborations, etc. Usually massively hopped beers, but also sour, fruit beers, stouts, Barley Wines, etc. in 33 and 44 cl. cans, bottles, and kegs. \r\n\r\n-Our core range beers: classic beers styles in 33 cl. bottles and kegs. (German Pils, Amber Ale, DH IPA, DIPA, Imp. Stout and N/A Amber Ale) focused on a general public but also really interesting for beer geeks because of it\'s price and quality. \r\n\r\nIf you are interested, we will be pleased to send you our cataloge and prices list, and of course some samples if you need it. \r\n\r\nHave a great summer and hope to hear from you soon. ', 'm.sanz@cervezasanfrutos.com', 'Cerveza SanFrutos', '139.47.53.16', 1691494686, '', '+33 678669509'),
