(483, 'PiÃ±ol', 'Judit', 'DOSKIWIS BREWING', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m Judit from Doskiwis Brewing, a brewery in EmpordÃ  (Girona).\r\nWe attended the BXL festival in Brussels im September and since then we have had some interest from people in France about our beers. One person asked Les 3 Moussequetaires in Metz and they told them they work with you for spanish breweries.\r\n\r\nI just wanted to see if you would be interested in exploring a collaboration and to know what areas do you serve.\r\n\r\nThank you so much!\r\nJudit', 'judit@doskiwisbrewing.com', 'DOSKIWIS BREWING ', '45.89.242.191', 1699449679, '', '+33 636554463'),
