ears / Imperial Stout / 11%</span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"8lb8c-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"8lb8c-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"8lb8c-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"539ev-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"539ev-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"539ev-0-0\">Orfila / IPA / 4,6%</span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"c7lhq-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"c7lhq-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"c7lhq-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"bje72-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"bje72-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"bje72-0-0\">Kayfabe / DIPA / 8%</span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"7lb5c-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"7lb5c-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"7lb5c-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"d95fh\" data-offset-key=\"lp4d-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"lp4d-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"lp4d-0-0\">Et retour de la fameuse Soup ! ?</span></div></div>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '1082, 1249, 488, 110', '', '0', 'Super mix up des meilleures références', ''),
(196, 'Sainte Cru retour de leur gamme permanente !', '//occitanieboissons.com/gallery/images/upload/image-SainteCruretourdeleurgammepermanente.png', 'image-SainteCruretourdeleurgammepermanente.png', 1638781585, '<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"2eatq\" data-offset-key=\"buuca-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"buuca-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"buuca-0-0\">Retour des classiques de la Brasserie Sainte Cru !</span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"2eatq\" data-offset-key=\"e1n4n-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"e1n4n-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"e1n4n-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"2eatq\" data-offset-key=\"19a9o-0-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div data-offset-key=\"19a9o-0-0\" class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"position: relative; direction: ltr;\"><span data-offset-key=\"19a9o-0-0\">Ca vient d\'arriver au dépôt et c\'est disponible dès maintenant en ligne ?</span></div></div>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '150', '', '0', 'L\'ensemble des bières permanentes sont disponibles !', ''),
(197, 'Hoppy Road', '//occitanieboissons.com/gallery/images/upload/image-HoppyRoad.png', 'image-HoppyRoad.png', 1639391516, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Pachacamac\r\n/ White Stout / 5% / 33cl</span></span></b><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière blonde\r\net gourmande aux saveurs torréfiées grâce aux fèves de cacao légèrement\r\ntoastées et un soupçon de vanille de Madagascar.</span>&nbsp;H</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">oublons&nbsp;:\r\nColumbus, Sabro Cryo</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Troy v2 /\r\nImperial Stout Orange Cacao / 8,8% / 33cl</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière noire\r\nintense et légèrement fruitée à l’orange et fèves de cacao</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Tatanka\r\nv2 / Imperial Stout Tonka / 10,6% / 33cl</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière\r\ngourmande et torréfiée à la fève de Tonka</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Calamity\r\n/ Imperial Stout Coco / 10,6% / 33cl</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière\r\ngourmande et torréfiée à la de noix de coco. </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Fuzz /\r\nDIPA / 8% / 44cl</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière\r\ntrouble et puissamment houblonnée </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Talus,\r\nSimcoe et Waimea</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">L’orée /\r\nRaw Ale Saison / 5,3% / 33cl (bouteille)</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Un profil\r\nsec et minéral pour cette bière blonde épicée et céréalière, travaillée comme\r\nune Raw Ale, sans ébullition.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Currant\r\nMood / Berliner Weisse Groseille Cassis / 4,2% / 33cl (bouteille)</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Bière de\r\nblé acidulée et fruitée : baies de groseille, cassis et de la fraicheur, une robe haute en couleur : de la bonne humeur en bouteille !&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Les retours des permanentes :&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Hazy\r\nRider / IPA / 6,4% / 33cl (bouteille)</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">Flamingo\r\n/ Berliner Weisse Hibiscus Citron Vert / 3,2% / 33cl (bouteille)</span></span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;;\">1984 /\r\nSaison acidulée / 6,5% / 33cl (bouteille)</span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '1108, 1250, 196', '', '0', 'De la stout pour tous les gouts !', ''),
(198, 'Basqueland collab des 6 ans ', '//occitanieboissons.com/gallery/images/upload/image-Basquelandcollabdes6ans.png', 'image-Basquelandcollabdes6ans.png', 1639566756, '<p>Basqueland a fêté son 6eme anniversaire avec de grandes collaborations !</p><p>Les 5 références sont arrivées aujourd\'hui au dépôt.</p>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '1186, 33, 234, 1251, 1252, 97', '', '0', 'Les collab\' pour les 6 ans de la brasserie Basqueland ', ''),
(199, 'Basqueland et les nouveautés ', '//occitanieboissons.com/gallery/images/upload/image-Basquelandetlesnouveautes.png', 'image-Basquelandetlesnouveautes.png', 1639566944, '<p>Head Honcho (DDH IPA) et Cat Skills (DIPA)</p>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '33, 1230', '', '0', 'Nouveautés éphémères de chez Basqueland', ''),
(200, 'Basqueland et les récurrentes', '//occitanieboissons.com/gallery/images/upload/image-Basquelandetlesrecurrentes.png', 'image-Basquelandetlesrecurrentes.png', 1639567071, '<p>On ne vous les présente plus !&nbsp;</p>', 'communication@occitanieboissons.com', '0', '33', '', '0', 'Elles font toujours leur retour en stock', '');
